            <note corresp="#d413-f3" n="2" xml:id="d413-f3-content">
                <p>The Secretary of State was informed in telegram 444, May 12, not printed:
                    “Government interventor Tanamo formally surrendered possession mill and
                    properties to company May 11 pursuant to resolution issued by Minister
                    Agriculture” (837.61351/5–1248).</p>
            </note>
